self.KB_CONTENT["card:779773"]={"id":"card:779773","ty":"card","sourceId":"779773","title":"『委外工單開立』中的『訂單單別 (TH042)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"訂單","keywords":["訂單","單別","單號","序號"],"y":"other","answer":"* 變動時清除訂單單號、訂單序號。* [F2]訂單資料查詢(COPTD-05)，並自動預設訂單單別、訂單單號、訂單序號欄位資料。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:779935"]={"id":"card:779935","ty":"card","sourceId":"779935","title":"『委外進貨單建立作業(IDL)』中的『幣別 (TH007)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"進貨單","keywords":["進貨單","幣別"],"y":"other","answer":"* 不可空白。* 預設本國幣別。亦可修改，點選(icon)或[F2]幣別資料查詢(CMSMF-01)。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
